    "sub_name": "畢業專題",
    "sub_ename": "GRADUATION PROJECT",
    "describe_ch": "畢業專題主要目的有四：（1）使學生親身體驗學用合一之歷程，進而了解其本質。（2）提升學生專業實作的能力。（3）激發學生解決問題的能力。（4）增進學生之表達能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The purposes of this course are as follows: (1) Enable students to understand the nature of learning to use. (2) Enhance students' competence of professional practice. (3) Stimulate students' ability to solve problems. (4) Improve students' ability to express.",
